 ## Background
-The Stratified Monte Carlo Radiance Estimate was introduced in the context of differentiable rendering with reparameterized volume sampling [S1, unofficial]. It builds on the idea of inverse transform sampling, which requires only a few points for degenerate distributions [S1, unofficial]. The method was compared against baseline uniform sampling and inverse transform sampling, showing consistent variance reduction [S1, unofficial].
